/* What a season's end did to the manager's club: Stayed in its division, was Promoted (a top three place below the first division), was Relegated (a bottom three place above the fourth) or won the league as Champions of the first division. */
ENUM ProGriddle.Games.FootballManager.SeasonMove:

    DEFINE ENUM Stayed = 0
                Promoted
                Relegated
                Champions.

END ENUM.
